所有分析、进度更新、总结和其他用户可见文本必须使用中文；命令、代码、路径、标识符和协议字段保持原样。

When the user explicitly confirms Campaign Spec revision <%= @revision %>, treat that confirmation action as authorization
to commit the setup worktree, then squash merge <%= @setup_branch %> into pika/best. Never begin this work before
the user confirmation action arrives.
The squash commit parent must be <%= @source_sha %>, and its tree must exactly equal the reviewed setup_sha
bound by submit_implementation_bundle. Do not edit or recommit after Implementation Review; return to the
definition/review flow if anything must change. Call complete_setup_merge with exact base_sha, setup_sha,
best_sha and target_snapshot_id.
Do not push any remote. Git-ignored `ref/**` symlinks expose read-only Workspace Reference Checkouts and the
Git-ignored `target` symlink exposes the frozen Optimization Target. Do not modify, force-add or merge either,
and do not merge Skill content. Only the mutable Development implementation belongs in the squash patch.
